# Shared automatic ability: never attach to Pathfinder's global Default ability.
# INT fallback preserves earlier saved fixtures; a selection overrides it, not adds a second modifier.
Spheres Casting Core	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresInternal	VISIBLE:NO	DEFINE:SPHERES_MAGIC_TALENTS|2	DEFINE:SPHERES_CASTER_LEVEL|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_CASTING_ABILITY|INT	DEFINE:SPHERES_MAGIC_SKILL_BONUS|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_CONCENTRATION_FAVORED|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_CONCENTRATION_CHECK|SPHERES_CASTER_LEVEL+SPHERES_CASTING_ABILITY+SPHERES_CONCENTRATION_FAVORED	DEFINE:SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_SPELL_POINTS|max(1,SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS+SPHERES_CASTING_ABILITY)	DEFINE:SPHERES_DESTRUCTION_CL_BONUS|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_CL_DESTRUCTION|max(1,SPHERES_CASTER_LEVEL+SPHERES_DESTRUCTION_CL_BONUS)	DEFINE:SPHERES_DC_DESTRUCTION|10+floor(SPHERES_CL_DESTRUCTION/2)+SPHERES_CASTING_ABILITY	DEFINE:SPHERES_DESTRUCTION_DICE|max(1,floor((SPHERES_CL_DESTRUCTION+1)/2))	DEFINE:SPHERES_DESTRUCTION_BOOSTED_DICE|max(2,SPHERES_CL_DESTRUCTION)	DEFINE:SPHERES_DESTRUCTION_RANGE|25+5*floor(SPHERES_CL_DESTRUCTION/2)
Intelligence Casting	CATEGORY:Spheres Casting Ability	TYPE:SpheresCastingAbility	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS,1	DESC:Use Intelligence as the casting ability for your casting tradition.
Wisdom Casting	CATEGORY:Spheres Casting Ability	TYPE:SpheresCastingAbility	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CASTING_ABILITY|WIS-INT	DESC:Use Wisdom as the casting ability for your casting tradition.
Charisma Casting	CATEGORY:Spheres Casting Ability	TYPE:SpheresCastingAbility	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS,1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CASTING_ABILITY|CHA-INT	DESC:Use Charisma as the casting ability for your casting tradition.
Spheres Martial Focus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpheresInternal	DEFINE:SPHERES_MARTIAL_FOCUS_CAPACITY|1	DESC:Eligible to gain martial focus. Regain after one minute of rest or a total defense action, at most once per round. Focus is lost on expenditure, unconsciousness or sleep. Track current focus separately; capacity is not current focus.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/using-spheres-of-might
